    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9102" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνιχν-εύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά,
